WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.995 --> 00:00:17.623
Settings, Security: two-factor authentication with any authenticator app.

2
00:00:17.623 --> 00:00:22.077
Sensitive changes ask you to confirm it is you first: here, the PIN.

3
00:00:22.077 --> 00:00:25.756
Scan the QR code, or type the setup key into the app.

4
00:00:25.756 --> 00:00:28.565
Enter the 6-digit code the app shows (RFC 6238, 30-second steps).

5
00:00:28.565 --> 00:00:33.596
Ten one-time recovery codes, shown once. Copy or download them.

6
00:00:33.596 --> 00:00:38.786
Two-factor authentication is on.

7
00:00:38.786 --> 00:00:41.447
Next login: the PIN first, then the authenticator code.

8
00:00:41.447 --> 00:00:47.966
Lost the phone? A recovery code works once instead.

9
00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:50.413
Logged in with the second factor.
